    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i have tried everything. supervisors, legal aid, different offices... it doesnt matter. they all just look through me like i'm not even there. it's like i'm already dead to them. i'm just sitting here in this empty apartment waiting for a letter that's never coming. what's even the point of fighting a machine that has already decided you don't exist?",
